# Paths deleted from the vendored subcharts after `helm dependency update`.
# One path per line, relative to this chart directory. Comments with #.
#
# The upstream chart declares minio as a conditional dependency so that a plain
# install gets object storage without an S3 account. It is gated on
# minio.enabled, which defaults to false, and we point OpenObserve at our own
# S3 endpoint instead, so it renders nothing. The published tarball carries it
# regardless, which is why this file exists: without it the subchart comes back
# on the next version bump.
charts/openobserve/charts/minio
